{
  "tema": 9255,
  "slug": "imperativo-tu-negativo",
  "titulo": "Forming negative tú commands",
  "subtitulo": "No hables, no digas, no pongas: the present subjunctive tells someone not to.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Negative tú commands use the tú form of the present subjunctive: no hables, no comas, no digas. Pronouns go before the verb.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To tell one person (**tú**) _not_ to do something, use **no** + the **tú** form of the **present subjunctive**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**no**",
            "**tú** present subjunctive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Infinitive",
            "Negative command"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "hablar",
              "no hables"
            ],
            [
              "comer",
              "no comas"
            ],
            [
              "decir",
              "no digas"
            ],
            [
              "poner",
              "no pongas"
            ],
            [
              "ser",
              "no seas"
            ],
            [
              "ir",
              "no vayas"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "All the subjunctive irregularities come along: stem changes (**no vuelvas**, **no pierdas**), **yo-go** verbs (**no digas**), spelling changes (**no toques**, **no pagues**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Object and reflexive pronouns go **before** the verb, after **no**: **no te muevas**, **no lo toques**, **no me digas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "This rule doesn't apply to affirmative commands, which have their own forms: **habla**, **di**, **pon** (see [[6748|affirmative tú commands]] and [[6962|irregular ones]])."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the moment you say **no**, flip to the subjunctive: **habla** becomes **no hables**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Estoy enojada. No ==digas== nada.",
              "en": "I'm upset. Don't say anything."
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==hables== tan rápido. No entiendo nada.",
              "en": "Don't talk so fast. I don't understand anything."
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==seas== necio y dame eso.",
              "en": "Don't be stubborn and give me that."
            },
            {
              "es": "Sé bueno y no ==pongas== los pies en la mesa.",
              "en": "Be good and don't put your feet on the table."
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==gastes== tanto en dulces.",
              "en": "Don't spend so much on candy."
            },
            {
              "es": "No te ==muevas==, ya casi abro el carro.",
              "en": "Don't move, I've almost got the car open."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
